Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,校内鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uwabaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.23,0:19:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,日本人吃的东西就像在军队里一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Japanese food is like the Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不言而喻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask, don't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在下外号黑闪 嘿 我发现你没有笔记本电脑啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name's Twinkie. Hey, I noticed you ain't have a laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.57,0:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.24,0:19:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你弄一台 半价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll hook you up. Half price.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.66,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 不需要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,四折怎么样 既然我们都是在军队里长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}60% off. Since we're both army brats and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 我可没钱啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't got no cash, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我不是军队里长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I ain't an army brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 那你要不来个手机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right. Well, what about a cell phone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,每个人都需要手机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody needs a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.76,0:19:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,无意冒犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能在这儿待不了多长时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm probably not gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没准连你的名字都记不住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be here long enough to remember your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,出门在外必须要买双好鞋啊 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you gonna need some new shoes to book town with, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢迈克尔·乔丹吗 我爱死他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like Michael Jordan? I love Michael Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这双{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,最新款的乔丹鞋 现在还没上市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brand new Jordans. Not even out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:19:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,连勒布朗·詹姆斯都没搞到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}LeBron James couldn't even get his hands on those.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你还卖斯巴寇的方向盘吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You selling that Sparco steering wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不卖 这是我自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, no. That's mine right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是我按零售价买的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, I even paid retail for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你开什么车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的车 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My ride? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.79,0:20:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的车可与众不同最时尚 - 带我看看去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My ride's one of a kind. - Show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.30,0:20:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你在这儿待不了多久呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought you weren't sticking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.59,0:20:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.69,0:21:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害吧 看看我的宝贝车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slamming, huh? Look at that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哦吼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,至少由我来开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least let me drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你带我去的地方最好有几辆像样的车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y'all better have some real cars around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你总算会说笑了 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I see somebody got jokes, huh? Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.95,0:21:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你到没到开车的年龄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you're ready for them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来可有点小紧张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.66,0:21:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗 托什{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What up, Tosh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,打飞机的时候用吧 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For when you blow your wad, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.64,0:23:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还是和我开车的方式不合适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still not right for the way I drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.52,0:23:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用电脑数据告诉我节流阀有什么反应{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need a computer to tell me about my throttle response.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.02,0:23:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 那就这样吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Then we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.11,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎用V8就没问题了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't have that problem with a V8.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,男孩子啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只关心谁的引擎马力最大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All they care about is who's got the biggest engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我骨子里就是如假包换的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a guy. It's in my DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.58,0:23:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你们就用这种车比赛 对吧 可爱的小玩具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So y'all race with these things, huh? Cute little toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.92,0:23:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你没穿拖鞋 我差点没认出你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I almost didn't recognize you without your slippers on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.21,0:23:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说制轮器吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you mean uwabaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.34,0:23:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫妮拉 对吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neela, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.55,0:23:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,学得挺快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a quick learner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.22,0:23:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where you from, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.01,0:23:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.64,0:23:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我不是问你住哪儿 我是问你家乡是哪里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I mean, not where you live. Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.06,0:23:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这个问题很重要吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it really matter where I'm from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.99,0:24:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这个新来的小子是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the tourist?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.24,0:24:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,D 你什么时候开始在意那个学生妹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with you and the schoolgirls, D?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.66,0:24:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,红颜多祸水 你得提高你的品位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're moving up in the world. You gotta elevate your company.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.96,0:24:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是周三 周三 来和周四打个招呼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wednesday, Wednesday, meet Thursday. God. Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.42,0:24:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,姑娘们 记住了啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ladies, hold that thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗 真棒 等我一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all right? All right, beautiful. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.14,0:24:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他正要走呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.14,0:24:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不会说日语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I don't speak Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.06,0:24:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看懂了吗 洋鬼子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand that'? Gaijin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,隆志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就聊聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的地盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't your scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.24,0:24:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才叫我“洋鬼子”还是什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That word you called me, gaijin or something or other,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.95,0:24:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what does that mean exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.96,0:24:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是 转过身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means, turn around,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.63,0:25:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.92,0:25:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这就准备走了 走吧 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what we gonna do. Come on, man, let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.46,0:25:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 他就是无赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, look, man, he's yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.01,0:25:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,挺有意思的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, see, that's funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.05,0:25:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我原以为这里是个自由的国度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'cause I thought this was, like, a free country
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.93,0:25:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,姑娘们可以想和谁聊天就和谁聊天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where a girl could talk to whoever she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.98,0:25:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁吗 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.23,0:25:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,知道 你就是日本的贾老板 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You're like the Justin Timberlake of Japan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.62,0:25:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 兄弟 你知道无赖是什么意思吗 就像黑手党{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, man. You know yakuza? The Mafia?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 抱歉 DK先生 小猴子今天没吃到香蕉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, sorry, DK-san. Monkey didn't have his banana today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.67,0:25:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 D 我们走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, D, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.42,0:25:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,该比赛了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to race.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.97,0:25:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,贾老板 祝你好运啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, Timberlake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.44,0:26:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,算你今天走运 因为我要去比赛了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one that's lucky, 'cause I'm about to race.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.36,0:26:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那就比一场啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.74,0:26:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿什么跟我比 滑板吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With what, huh? Your skateboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.04,0:26:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没车的时候怎么吹牛逼都行啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy to sound cocky when you got no ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,开我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.96,0:26:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,比一场吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.34,0:26:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 我就想看看那孩子有什么本事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I wanna see what the kid's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.68,0:26:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他会开车吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.27,0:26:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,会开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道DK什么意思吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what DK stands for?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大金刚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Donkey Kong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.70,0:26:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,漂移之王{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drift King.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.70,0:26:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,漂移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.83,0:26:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,漂移是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean, drift?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.51,0:27:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要查查什么意思吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still need a dictionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那张名画吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that real famous painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就是有个女人一直微笑的那张{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one of the woman who's smiling all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蒙娜丽莎 - 对对对 就是蒙娜丽莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Mona Lisa. - Right, right, right. Mona Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.39,0:27:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, look, man, this car right
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.77,0:27:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这辆车就是漂移界的蒙娜丽莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}here's like the Mona Lisa of the drift world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.85,0:27:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,韩从基础部分改造重塑了这辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han rebuilt this bad boy from ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.65,0:27:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是经过改造的活塞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talking forged pistons,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.45,0:27:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,更大马力的发动机 新的牵引杆和机轴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bigger turbo, new rods, new crankshaft.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.19,0:27:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 韩可不是廉价劳动力 懂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, Han's labor ain't cheap, man, you feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.53,0:27:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我需要三十秒学学怎么漂移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if I needed a 30-second lesson on how to drift...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.87,0:27:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.68,0:27:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,漂移有很多种方法 懂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's lots of ways you can do this, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.62,0:27:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,手动刹车是最简单的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hand braking is the easiest,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.79,0:27:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你要做的第一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so the first thing I want you to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.07,0:27:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就是猛拉手刹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to rip that e-brake.
