Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.84,0:27:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 你只要别毁了蒙娜丽莎就好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? Just don't mess up Mona, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.99,0:28:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.78,0:29:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.07,0:30:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.45,0:30:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.03,0:31:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.85,0:32:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别跑哦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.11,0:33:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道现在几点了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.41,0:33:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为才七点左右{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was around 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,美国时间要延后几个小时呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, US is a few hours behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.87,0:33:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来这边的派对更好玩一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like the party was better here, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.67,0:33:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 你去飙车了是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been racing, Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.84,0:33:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能在这待下去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.10,0:33:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,随你便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.94,0:33:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你没明白 是吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.73,0:33:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你已无处可去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.27,0:33:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,如果在这儿都不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it doesn't work out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.03,0:33:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你就得去坐牢 懂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're going to jail. Do you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.16,0:33:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是游戏 我再告诉你一次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't a game. And I'm gonna tell you one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.41,0:33:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是想在我这儿住下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you're gonna live under my roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.56,0:33:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就要遵守我的规则 要不你就给我滚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna go by my rules or get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.83,0:33:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.38,0:34:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.84,0:34:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.76,0:34:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,上车吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.64,0:34:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我会赔钱给你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好像你不用赔钱似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you talking like you have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.62,0:35:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,里边有个带爪子的家伙欠我钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a guy in there with a paw that owes me some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.16,0:35:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,爪子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Paw?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.87,0:35:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,去把我的钱要回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get me my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.38,0:35:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,韩说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han said,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.56,0:36:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}okane.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.11,0:36:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,韩说 还钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han send, okane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.56,0:37:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.82,0:37:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在开始做送货的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the pickup and delivery business now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.95,0:37:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我打电话给你 你就要随叫随到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I might call you once a week or once an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.62,0:37:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管你是生病了还是在和碧昂斯滚床单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care if you're sick as a dog or in bed with Beyonce.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.00,0:37:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,叫你就得来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call, you show.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.75,0:37:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 除非你教我漂移 - 你没有讨价还价的余地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only if you teach me how to drift. - This ain't a negotiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没讨价还价{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.22,0:38:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他来这干什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing here?
