Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.14,0:38:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,希望不是他开车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope he's not driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.11,0:38:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,洋鬼子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gaijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你下次什么时候比赛 我很想去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When is your next race? I'd really like to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.57,0:38:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不参加呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not be in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.07,0:38:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的是个小混蛋牛仔啊 还是就随口说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really a bad ass, cowboy, or you just talk like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.20,0:38:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见我的话了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.58,0:38:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还想再毁一辆车啊 韩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to lose another car, Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.29,0:38:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要你那辆86年的卡罗拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready to take that '86 Corolla off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.42,0:38:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.09,0:39:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,拿你72年的天际线来赌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put up the '72 Skyline.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.14,0:39:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,成交{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.85,0:39:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,让他出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him out of here.
