Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.62,0:39:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的货来晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your shipment's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.49,0:39:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始在意这些细节了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when are you so worried about the details?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.50,0:39:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,韩 你的货什么时候到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When is the shipment arriving, Han?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我会去处理的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just sit pretty and let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.11,0:40:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 爸 是我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dad, it's me.
