Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.41,0:40:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我会晚点到家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'll be home a little later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.87,0:40:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.33,0:40:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不能再跟着我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really need to stop following me around.
