Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.14,0:40:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,向你男朋友学学漂移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ask your boyfriend for some drifting lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.22,0:40:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 你不想进入我们的圈子的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. You don't wanna be a part of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.93,0:40:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是混得挺好的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.72,0:40:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你一点都不了解我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.81,0:40:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得我不了解{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, why don't you think I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.19,0:40:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是个洋鬼子 是个外人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause I'm a gaijin? An outsider?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.19,0:40:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.19,0:40:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你是从军队里出身的 一直在搬家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an army brat who moved around a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.95,0:40:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸妈从来不回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mama and daddy was never home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.53,0:40:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你到处闯祸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you walked around pissed off all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.53,0:40:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你把这些漂移族当成你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you found your family with these drift nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.58,0:40:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没猜对 牛仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero for one, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.01,0:41:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不像其他白人一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't you go find a nice Japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.81,0:41:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,找个可爱的日本姑娘呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}girl like the rest of the white guys around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.86,0:41:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一切没问题吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everything okay back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.90,0:41:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我应付得了DK{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can handle DK.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.49,0:41:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他就是个黑社会无赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought he's yakuza.
