Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.96,0:51:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道以前的西部地区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know those old Westerns
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.05,0:51:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,牛仔们都会奋力跑过边界吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the cowboys make a run for the border?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.64,0:51:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是我的墨西哥{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.02,0:51:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么让我开你的车比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why'd you let me race with your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我会撞坏的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew I was gonna wreck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.52,0:51:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.02,0:51:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,因为会浪费一大笔钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause it's a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.19,0:51:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的是钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.03,0:51:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要周围有我能信得过的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's trust and character I need around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.53,0:51:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,选好了身边的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, who you choose
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.03,0:51:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,才能让你更了解自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be around you lets you know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.75,0:52:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一辆车可以换来对自己的认知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one car in exchange for knowing what a man's made of,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.67,0:52:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很划算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's a price I can live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.17,0:52:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你看看下面那些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at all those people down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.39,0:52:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们循规蹈矩是为了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They follow the rules, for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.01,0:52:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让恐惧引领着他们的生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're letting fear lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.23,0:52:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们不这么做会怎么样呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens if they don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.06,0:52:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,生活很简单 做出选择就不回头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Life's simple. You make choices and you don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.37,0:52:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 如果你漂移不是为了赢得比赛 那你为什么要漂移呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if you don't drift to win, what do you drift for?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.55,0:52:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的想知道吗 - 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You really want to know? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.01,0:52:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好 跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.96,0:54:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,漂移要持之以恒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no "Wax on, wax off" With drifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.92,0:54:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,边做边学{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn by doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.26,0:54:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,发明漂移的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first drifters invented
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.74,0:54:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,从这山路上来感受它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}drifting out here in the mountains by feeling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.76,0:54:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你也感觉一下吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.73,0:54:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.24,0:54:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 包里放什么了 - 等会你就知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's in this bag? - You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.07,0:54:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有多少 - 有的是呢 多来点吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much you got? - Keep going, keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.54,0:54:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我爽翻了 兄弟 我都能把避孕套卖给和尚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so good, man, I could sell rubbers to a monk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.22,0:55:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.36,0:55:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,再来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.96,0:55:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,别着急 别着急 不要太早 就现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it. Watch it. Not too early, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.38,0:55:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.86,0:55:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,别松开 别松开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lose it! Don't lose it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.73,0:56:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 韩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Han...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.81,0:56:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.07,0:56:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有人来看你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a visitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.33,0:56:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 黑闪 给他准备个位置{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Twink. Get this man a bunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.65,0:58:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,合作愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pleasure doing business.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.20,0:58:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 宝贝 我告诉过你 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby. I told you. I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.87,0:58:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,其实还不错 我番茄酱都还没放呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's actually not bad. I didn't even have to put ketchup on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.87,0:59:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 我不是个完完全全的洋鬼子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I'm not a total gaijin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.79,0:59:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌这个词{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate that word. It's
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.18,0:59:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从小我就被人这么叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what they used to call me when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.30,0:59:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你是在这出生的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were born here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.59,0:59:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,“外人”有很多不同的意义{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, "Outsider" Can mean many different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.98,0:59:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈在我十岁那年就去世了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom died when I was 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.40,0:59:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她高中毕业之后就从澳大利亚到了日本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She came out here from Australia when she finished high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.98,0:59:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all I know about her
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.47,0:59:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她去做了酒吧的舞女{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that she went to work in a hostess bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.20,0:59:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,DK的祖母收留了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DK's grandmother took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.50,0:59:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我父母在我三岁的时候离婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, my parents split up when I was three.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.58,0:59:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我妈妈总是搬家 主要是因为我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Mom moved around a lot. Mostly 'cause of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.92,0:59:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 全都是因为我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it was all 'cause of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.18,0:59:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我总是让我自己变成外人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of made myself an outsider, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.89,0:59:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想都没想过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without even thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.31,1:00:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在我意识到了外人还是本地人 其实都不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I realize now, outsider or insider, it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.11,1:00:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的是要知道自己心中真正想要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that matters is knowing what you really want
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.19,1:00:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,并且为之努力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and going after it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.05,1:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们小的时候经常到这来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We used to come up here when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.30,1:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至不到开车年龄的时候就翘课溜出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even before we could drive we'd cut class, sneak out,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.72,1:00:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到这来看大一点的孩子漂移{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come up here, and watch the older kids drift.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.98,1:00:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候情况不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things were different back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.07,1:00:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,当我一拿到驾照 我就在这扎根了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once I got my license, I practically lived up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.49,1:00:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候 孩子们什么车都敢开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back then, kids just drove whatever they had.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:01:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是自娱自乐 没有人打扰我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, we just made do. No one bothered us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.33,1:01:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到驾照的那一天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day I got my license
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.82,1:01:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我第一次拿到超速罚单的那天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the day I got my first speeding ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.50,1:01:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,第二天 我赢了人生中第一场比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The day after that, I won my first race.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.42,1:01:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了那个富二代三个车身的距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I beat this rich kid by three lengths.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.97,1:01:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我得承认那感觉爽呆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta admit, it felt good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.51,1:01:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It felt like...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.10,1:01:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的一切都消失了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like everything else just disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.31,1:01:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有过去没有将来 - 没有烦恼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No past and no future. - No problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.86,1:01:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那个时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.97,1:01:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要降降温了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy needs to chill.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.14,1:02:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 黑闪 我还要一套轮胎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Twink, I'm gonna grab another set.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.43,1:02:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔喔喔 还要一套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! Whoa, whoa, whoa! Another set?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 听着 今天都三套了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Look, that was your third set today.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.30,1:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,轮胎可不便宜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, them tires ain't cheap.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.49,1:02:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,DK 坐吧 我们来烤点蘑菇吃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DK, grab a chair. We're about to roast some marshmallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.12,1:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哟 冷静点 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yo, come on, man, look...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.17,1:02:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,离她远点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from her,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.13,1:02:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要不你能开的东西就只有轮椅了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the only thing you'll be driving is a wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.48,1:02:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,找个新车手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find yourself a new driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.07,1:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 你到底想怎样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm all right. - What'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.33,1:03:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不仅在玩火{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't just play with fire,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.05,1:03:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这都引火烧身了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you soaked the matches in gasoline.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.40,1:03:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.50,1:03:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就因为那个洋鬼子 - 我就是个洋鬼子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All this over a gaijin? - I am a gaijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.76,1:04:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你变了 DK{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've changed, DK.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.85,1:04:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我变了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You say I've changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.98,1:04:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你和我也没什么不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're not so different, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.90,1:04:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是私生子 不是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both products of screw ups, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.74,1:04:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说你妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say your mom was the best trick
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.08,1:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是那时候歌舞伎町最棒的舞娘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all of Kabukicho back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.12,1:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别把我妈妈扯进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave my mother out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.83,1:04:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们没有收留你 你就跟她一样了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we hadn't taken you in, you'd be just like her,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.13,1:04:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为了挣钱可以做任何事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doing anything for a buck.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.30,1:04:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,人们愿意跟随你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think anyone would take a
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.69,1:04:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是因为你有个叔叔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}second look at you if it wasn't for your uncle?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.90,1:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是一样的 妮拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the same, Neela.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.65,1:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不同的是我知道我是谁 属于哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difference is I know who I am and where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.75,1:05:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你是谁吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.54,1:05:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你属于哪里吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know where you belong?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.32,1:05:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.41,1:05:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.78,1:09:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你担保 我用我的名誉在给你担保{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I vouched for you! Put my reputation on the line for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.50,1:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是搭档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were partners!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.25,1:09:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能背后搞小动作坑我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you can keep your side deals from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.17,1:09:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 我们都不是小孩了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We ain't in the Boy Scouts.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.92,1:09:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这再正常不过了 - 隆志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is what we do. - Takashi!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.52,1:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,现在怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.31,1:10:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.19,1:10:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是正常的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.48,1:10:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你需要我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.36,1:10:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是有我在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd still be shaking down
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.64,1:10:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你还在敲诈茶室赚钱吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tea houses for chump change if it wasn't for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.41,1:10:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 上车 - 快 快 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in! - Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.25,1:10:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.12,1:13:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 肖恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sean, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.21,1:16:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,隆志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Takashi.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.55,1:16:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是你 我就不会这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't do that if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.10,1:17:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.44,1:17:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.32,1:17:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妮拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neela.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.54,1:17:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等你爸比不在的时候咱们再聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you when Daddy's not around.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.35,1:17:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我今天晚上就会把你送上飞机 - 爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm putting you on a plane tonight. - Dad...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.61,1:17:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 别跟我吵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sean, don't argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.32,1:17:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的错 我不能一走了之{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did this. I can't run away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.28,1:17:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.36,1:17:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 我是你父亲 我要对你的行为负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sean, I'm your father. I'm responsible for your well-being.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.62,1:17:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要为我自己犯的错负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm responsible for my mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.79,1:18:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去弥补{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.79,1:18:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你能明白吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.81,1:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你没有重蹈我的覆辙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least you're not redoing my mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.26,1:18:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你还好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.89,1:19:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这个城市 听着 我认识一些人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're leaving town. Look, I know some people...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.31,1:19:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能跑 黑闪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't do it, Twink.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.07,1:19:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 DK要杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, DK wants your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.03,1:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.78,1:19:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你把麻烦惹到蒲田头上了 你完蛋了 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the trouble you just made for Kamata? You're done here, bro.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.62,1:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也许我该直接和蒲田聊聊 - 什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe I should talk to Kamata. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.58,1:19:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,DK都听他的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DK answers to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.05,1:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就当我刚才什么都没听见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I just didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.34,1:19:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我要结束这一切 我必须要和他谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta end this. I'm gonna go talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.80,1:19:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you crazy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.01,1:19:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,韩死了 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Han is dead, all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.68,1:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 你不能就这么直愣愣的走到蒲田的地盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, you can't just walk into Kamata's place, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.81,1:19:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这一个办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all I got.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.95,1:19:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,韩应该想要你带上这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something I think Han would've wanted you to have.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.71,1:20:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.76,1:20:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想活着从蒲田的地盘出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need it if
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.17,1:20:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你会需要这些的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna make it out of Kamata's place alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.27,1:20:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you need it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.64,1:20:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不用了 我自己可以解决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's cool. Look, I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.05,1:21:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sean.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.89,1:21:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.89,1:21:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你来错地方了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came to the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.19,1:21:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来见你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't come here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.68,1:22:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.01,1:22:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以走进来 撇下这些钱然后就走出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can walk in here, dump some cash and walk out?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.69,1:22:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,首先我只是想把你的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm only returning
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.13,1:22:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还给你 蒲田先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what belonged to you in the first place, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.23,1:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不是为了这个来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not why I really came.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.11,1:22:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来道歉的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.37,1:22:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的侄子和我有些小矛盾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know your nephew and I have embarrassed ourselves badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.96,1:23:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我到这里来 是为了向您提供一个和平的解决方案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm here to offer you a peaceful solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.39,1:23:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you plan to accomplish that?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.31,1:23:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A race.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.69,1:23:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我和DK给你还有所有人带来了麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DK and I have caused nothing but problems for you, for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.57,1:23:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我请求你允许我们自己解决 一劳永逸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm asking you to allow us to settle this, once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.37,1:23:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We race
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.33,1:23:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,输的人永远离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the loser leaves town for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.50,1:23:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经赢过你这个孬种一次了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've already beat this piece of shit once!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.50,1:23:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.59,1:23:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那就简单了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it should be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.54,1:24:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,警察把所有车都拖走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cops took all the cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.92,1:24:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.50,1:25:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是它不行的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why she's spitting.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.65,1:26:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就快好了 再调试几次就行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We almost there, Twink. Couple more tweaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.74,1:26:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我担心的不是车 伙计{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the car I'm worried about, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.49,1:26:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,DK选择这条路是有原因的 这是他的山{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}DK picked this road for a reason. This is his mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.50,1:26:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他是唯一一个能从头开到尾的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only one to ever make it to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.57,1:30:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,耶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.91,1:30:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 - 干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah! - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.14,1:31:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.36,1:31:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.69,1:31:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 肖恩 - 冲啊 冲啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, Sean. - Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.40,1:31:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,肖恩 你最牛逼 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sean, you the boss. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.47,1:32:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠 挺住啊 兄弟 这不对啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Come on, man! That ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.81,1:34:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 肖恩 我就说嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, baby! That's what I'm talking about, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.94,1:34:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我就说嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.60,1:34:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.09,1:35:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿哟 肖恩 哟 肖恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, yo, Sean! Yo, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.88,1:35:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 快来看啊 兄弟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, check this out, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.89,1:35:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有个家伙要和新漂移王赛车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This dude over here wanna race the new DK.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.72,1:35:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,听说他在亚洲所向披靡啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard he's been beating everybody around Asia, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.60,1:35:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚不行 黑闪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not tonight, Twinkie.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.90,1:35:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他说他认识韩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said he knew Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说韩是他的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Said Han was family.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.92,1:36:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.63,1:36:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,来比一场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's race.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.99,1:36:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,车不错啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.79,1:36:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,几年前从韩那赢来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won it from my friend Han, a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.88,1:36:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道他喜欢美国老爷车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know he was into American muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.63,1:36:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他和我一起混的时候就喜欢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was when he was rolling with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.76,1:37:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是十秒跑四分之一英里的比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know this ain't no 10-second race.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.68,1:37:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我有的是时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got nothing but time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.18,1:37:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.61,1:37:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 肖恩 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Sean! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.33,1:37:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,各就位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.58,1:37:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,预备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.96,1:37:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
